Note = {ASIA Pacific International Conference on Environment-Behaviour Studies
   (AicE-Bs), Kuching, MALAYSIA, DEC 07-09, 2010},
Abstract = {This session reports on a study that aimed to explore the benefits of
   conducting drama activities outdoors. Apart from identifying suitable
   activities that students believe to be effective in outdoor settings,
   the study also examined the problems involved in the carrying out of
   such activities. The study was carried out among Pre TESL students of
   UiTM Pahang, Kuantan Campus. These students were selected to respond to
   the questionnaire distributed to them after taking part in drama
   activities in the outdoor environments. The session will present the
   overall results of the study, revealing the beneficial effects of
   carrying drama activities outdoors as well as some of the problems of
   conducting drama activities in outdoor environments. It will also
   present some suitable activities that students believe to be suitable
   outdoors such as drama games and short drama. (C) 2012 Published by
