   Governance Design \& Environm Management Megacities Search Solut},
Abstract = {Cities are rapidly developing and growing, new technologies and
   materials allow bringing modern architecture to a new level. This
   applies to residential, public and industrial areas, both their location
   within the city and their internal filling. This development makes
   cities more comfortable and safe for human life, and also allows finding
   new solutions in the aesthetic design of the urban environment. Space,
   subject to an adult, is not always subject to a child, so it is worth
   paying special attention to the design of children's spaces. All
   possible factors from safety rules to psychology shall be considered to
   develop the best design of space for children. It is in the process of
   socialization in the world around the children that a general picture of
   the world develops, character is tempered and even their life path is
   determined. Street zones, represented in the form of children's
   playgrounds and sports grounds in the territories of various children's
   institutions, have approached the threshold and are ready to develop
   together with the passage of time, which gives us the opportunity to
   carefully consider this project.},
