Abstract = {Crime occurrences in Malaysia do not directly reflect that they are
   transport-related but for women travellers, the higher the crime rate in
   an area, the higher would be the chances of becoming a crime victim.
   This creates insecurity among woman travellers in urban areas. Thus,
   this study intended to examine the hot spot crime occurrence for working
   women who depend on public bus. Results show that most women feel
   insecure while waiting at the bus stop, when they are not comfortable
   with services, when there is no indication of security and when they
   receive no information of the bus services. (C) 2012 The Authors.
