   Alicante},
Abstract = {This work analyses certain influences of climatological variables on the
   city, as well as the main interactions between green spaces and the
   environmental parameters which form the urban environment. Several
   comfort indices were used in different parts of the eight districts most
   representative of the urban complex. The formulation of these indices
   was statistically correlated with the green zone areas, in order to find
   out the surface area of these areas that the city should have in order
   for this to be considered theoretically comfortable. The scenario for
   the study was in all cases the city of Valencia (Spain), taken as a
   prototype of the Mediterranean city.},
