Organization = {CE Bs; FAPS; UiTM},
Abstract = {Residential developments have long term impacts on the communities, and
   the surrounding of the neighbourhood. The regional and local legislated
   policy and guidelines for sustainable development have been put in place
   such as Local Agenda 21, National Landscape Policy and Greater KL/KV
   green initiatives. However, it is still a new trend for housing
   development in Malaysia. This study aims to investigate the extent
   sustainable landscape design approach has been implemented in
   residential development in Klang Valley. It is hoped to guide landscape
   architecture practitioners, policy makers and urban designer to
   incorporate sustainable landscape design approach for a conducive living
