Abstract = {Fluoride is one of the fundamental and required components in human
   body. Fluoride concentration in underground water may arrive to several
   mg/lit because they transmit the fluoride-rich parts. The current study
   intends to survey the status of fluoride in underground water source and
   drinking water in Qaemshahr city from 2006 (march/21) to 2012(march/19)
   and comparison with universalstandards, national and climatic
