Note = {Urban Transitions Conference, Shanghai, PEOPLES R CHINA, SEP, 2016},
Abstract = {The purpose of this paper is to clarify the confusion on the definition
   of place attachment and its overlap with other related terms in
   landscape study. Besides a theoretical framework of place attachment was
   formed to help on the assessment of place attachment. This can help to
   underpin an understanding of the importance of place attachment in
   modern urban design processes and to protect such identities to form a
   better urban environment. Moreover, the paper propose a way to assess
   the place attachment via modern Virtual Reality technology, in searching
   for a better way to assess the term, hence helping practitioners to
   better identify and protect the elements that contribute to place
   attachment. Its guidance ability on finding place attachment elements in
   urban development process provides a strong practical value.},
