Abstract = {Ideally landscape should provide the public with a rich sense of
   perception. With the semiotic theory of landscape, we can see that there
   are three elements for the ideographic symbol means: graphic, indicator
   and token symbol. Through multiple case analysis of landscape, we found
   token symbols associated with the cultural background, which can produce
