Abstract = {Most construction workers are exposed to situations where they feel that
   their personal safety is compromised. A survey on occupational health
   and safety was distributed to a group of electricians to try to capture
   their concerns and perceptions about safety on the job. A classification
   scheme was developed from their responses. The data was used to evaluate
   possible changes that can be made on job sites as suggested by the
